<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 15:01:20 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>世界更热，预算更紧：世界自然基金会气候周 2026 年测试</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/world-wildlife-fund-climate-week/</link><description>自然是气候基础设施。这也是资金最少的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2282954695-e1789912714319.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 14:04:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/world-wildlife-fund-climate-week/</guid></item><item><title>即使在 NIL 时代，大学体育运动也对学生运动员不利——现在缺乏透明度阻碍了他们进入“公平市场”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/college-sports-athletes-nil-transparency-fair-market/</link><description>如果没有像职业体育那样的集体谈判协议，大学运动员只能盲目地应对“零”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294502413-e1789763140310.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/college-sports-athletes-nil-transparency-fair-market/</guid></item><item><title>亿万富翁梅琳达·法兰西·盖茨 (Melinda French Gates) 曾透露，尽管 Z 世代女儿的初创公司价值超过 340 亿美元，但她拒绝资助该公司</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/melinda-french-gates-reveals-shes-refusing-to-fund-her-gen-z-daughters-startup/</link><description>微软联合创始人比尔·盖茨长期以来一直警告说，他的孩子们不会靠他的财富而享福，而梅琳达·法兰西·盖茨则坚持让女儿自己筹集资金，以确保这种心态尽早开始。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/GettyImages-670733454-e1751906017785.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 13:26:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/melinda-french-gates-reveals-shes-refusing-to-fund-her-gen-z-daughters-startup/</guid></item><item><title>Zoom 首席执行官同意比尔·盖茨、黄仁勋和杰米·戴蒙的观点：由于人工智能，每周 3 天的工作制即将到来</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/zoom-ceo-eric-yuan-agrees-with-bill-gates-jensen-huang-jamie-dimon-3-day-workweek-coming-soon/</link><description>Zoom 领导人 Eric Yuan 承认，这项技术将消除一些人类工作，但那些保住工作的人将享受更少的工作日。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/GettyImages-2175654021-e1757947434614.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 13:24:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/zoom-ceo-eric-yuan-agrees-with-bill-gates-jensen-huang-jamie-dimon-3-day-workweek-coming-soon/</guid></item><item><title>沃伦·巴菲特和比尔·盖茨的捐赠誓言的慈善事业领导人表示，亿万富翁的子女正在推动他们更快地捐出财富</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/giving-pledge-next-gen-leader-katherine-lorenz-push-for-faster-philanthropy-milken-institute-report-younger-heirs-rewriting-rules-millionaires-billionaires/</link><description>历史性的 124 万亿美元财富转移正在进行中，许多继承人正在利用他们的影响力向老一代人施加压力，要求他们更快地花掉财富。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-475794198-e1782496570459.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 13:20:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/giving-pledge-next-gen-leader-katherine-lorenz-push-for-faster-philanthropy-milken-institute-report-younger-heirs-rewriting-rules-millionaires-billionaires/</guid></item><item><title>约会应用程序试图通过泡菜球、问答之夜和减少聊天来缓解刷卡疲劳</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/dating-apps-tinder-bumble-breeze-irl-events-gen-z-swipe-fatigue/</link><description>随着付费用户数量下降，Tinder、Bumble 和 Breeze 都在押注现实世界的事件。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-505963814-e1789772201361.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/dating-apps-tinder-bumble-breeze-irl-events-gen-z-swipe-fatigue/</guid></item><item><title>希尔顿仅 72 个实习岗位就收到了 12,000 份 Z 世代申请——其首席人力资源官表示，人工智能让酒店业工作更具竞争力</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/hilton-applications-gen-zers-internships-early-career-program-chro-ai-hospitality-jobs/</link><description>只有 0.4% 的年轻申请者能够进入希尔顿的早期职业生涯计划，甚至比常春藤盟校还要挑剔。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2159442797-e1789764087122.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/hilton-applications-gen-zers-internships-early-career-program-chro-ai-hospitality-jobs/</guid></item><item><title>Axios 创始人讲述人工智能如何毁掉你的收件箱、为什么 90 年代确实不同以及如何通过“简化”取得成功</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/axios-founders-vandehei-allen-schwartz-simplify-book-interview/</link><description>Jim VandeHei、Mike Allen 和 Roy Schwartz 表示，原本应该节省我们时间的技术却起到了相反的效果。他们的书探讨了如何“简化”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2149733715-e1789650141769.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/axios-founders-vandehei-allen-schwartz-simplify-book-interview/</guid></item><item><title>我的第一家律师事务所向客户收取每小时 600 美元的费用，让我使用我的哈佛学位进行数据输入。感谢上帝，人工智能正在改变这个行业</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/logan-brown-ai-law-founder-harvard-law-school-data-entry-disruption/</link><description>无论业界是否喜欢，人工智能的引入正在重塑人才的分布和资源的可用性。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Logan-Brown-Headshot100.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/logan-brown-ai-law-founder-harvard-law-school-data-entry-disruption/</guid></item><item><title>一位 71 岁的老人以放射科医生和教授的身份退休，现在经营着一家香蕉串生意：“我从来都不想退休。你为什么要这么做？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/retired-professor-radiologist-richard-brown-turning-to-entreprenuership-career-success-starting-over-poka-snack/</link><description>理查德·布朗的职业生涯把他从考场带到了教室和董事会。 71 岁了，他仍在工作，现在专注于创业。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RichardBrown.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 09:34:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/retired-professor-radiologist-richard-brown-turning-to-entreprenuership-career-success-starting-over-poka-snack/</guid></item></channel></rss>